# --- Public site vs local-only ---
# Public (do commit): myst.yml, index.md, custom.css, logo, fonts/,
# book/ pages and images, files/ (404, downloads, reading-player.html),
# joined Readings audio/*.mp3, .github/workflows.
#
# Local only (do not commit):

# Clip cache and manifests. Joined Readings at audio/*.mp3 stay site assets.
*.mp3
!audio/*.mp3
audio/clips/
audio/*.json

# TTS synthesis: API keys, venv, clip tooling
text-to-audio/

# Local Python (TTS helpers, publications generator, SEO postprocess)
scripts/

# Agent notes, ADRs, and research writeups
AGENTS.md
docs/

